{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["AMAIM Warrior at the Borderline UltraSteel Ogre-Gear","A new Kyoukai Senki project directed by Masami Oobari.\n\n\n\nAfter the end of the Hokuriku front, a new land for the Japanese people was created, governed by the New Japan Cooperation Organization. However, this did not dramatically improve the situation in Japan. The effective control of the various powers in the country continued, and the oppression of the Japanese people, though lessened, continued. The same is true of the isolated islands in the South Sea. The Oceania Army, which is in effective control of the island, and the resistance organization \"Hinukan\" that resists them. Then the North American forces attacks, aiming to take over the isolated island--.\n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll News)"],"ja":["境界戦機 極鋼ノ装鬼",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-54495","ids":{"shikimori":54495,"mal":54495,"anilist":161647,"kodik":"serial-53628"},"kodikIds":["serial-53085","serial-53628"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-53085":"2023-10-20T07:04:43Z","serial-53628":"2023-10-19T17:37:15Z"},"title":"Воины пограничья: Демон в стальной броне","originalTitle":"Kyoukai Senki: Kyokkou no Souki","alt":"Воины пограничья WEB AMAIM Warrior at the Borderline UltraSteel Ogre-Gear 境界戦機 極鋼ノ装鬼","description":"Новая часть франшизы Воины пограничья .","year":2023,"type":"ONA","genres":["Фантастика","меха"],"rating":5.73,"popularity":1938,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/54495/9449665f0d5c385d1416703fb00cb50f.jpeg","width":705,"height":990},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/744d84888262ee30a64fcd94c80b08e7254efdb1.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending